10 REM ** TU NOMBRE EN GRANDE **›20 DIM N$(20)›30 PRINT "COMO TE LLAMAS";:INPUT N$›40 IF LEN(N$)=0 OR LEN(N$)>19 THEN 30›50 GRAPHICS 2+16›60 FOR I=1 TO 12›70 POSITION INT(RND(0)*(20-LEN(N$))),INT(RND(0)*11)›80 PRINT #6;N$;›90 FOR W=1 TO 150:NEXT W›100 NEXT I›110 IF PEEK(764)=255 THEN 50›120 POKE 764,255:GRAPHICS 0›